sequenceDiagram
    actor Reviewer
    participant UI as Reviewer Dashboard
    participant API as Backend Views (Django)
    participant DB as SQLite Database
    
    Reviewer->>UI: Click "Evaluate Paper"
    UI->>Reviewer: Open Evaluation Modal
    Reviewer->>UI: Enter Scores (0-10) & Feedback
    Reviewer->>UI: Click Submit
    UI->>API: POST /api/evaluations/submit/ {criteria_scores}
    API->>API: Calculate total_score = sum(criteria_scores)
    API->>DB: Save Evaluation Record
    API->>DB: Update Poster Status to "EVALUATED"
    DB-->>API: Success
    API-->>UI: 201 Created (Success)
    UI-->>Reviewer: Close Modal & Refresh Dashboard
